# Build context hygiene: nothing here belongs in the image, and some of it must
# never be baked in at all.

# Secrets and local config. `.env` and `*.pem` carry key material — the CLI
# reads them from the environment/mounts at runtime, never from the image.
.env
.env.*.local
*.pem
kek.bin
s3vault.yaml
s3vault-local.yaml

# Build output and scratch space.
dist/
bin/
coverage.out
coverage.html
/s3vault
tmp/

# VCS and CI metadata: the build uses --buildvcs=false, so git history is
# dead weight (and large).
.git
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Docs and stand: the image ships the binary only.
README.md
AGENTS.md
architecture.md
docs/
compose.e2e.yaml
scripts/
